SHiVAi-rs — SHiVAi in Rust, for the browser (WebAssembly + WebGPU) and the command line (AGPL-3.0-or-later)

Ported from SHiVAi (https://github.com/pboutinaud/SHiVAi), Copyright (C) 2024 Fealinx,
AGPL-3.0-or-later, registered at the Agence pour la Protection des Programmes
(IDDN.FR.001.410014.000.S.P.2024.000.21000): the preprocessing (shivai/utils/preprocessing.py,
interfaces/image.py, workflows/*), the prediction ensemble (scripts/predict_multi.py) and the
cluster post-processing (postprocessing/clusters.py).

Also ported: nibabel.processing.conform / rescale_affine (MIT), scipy.ndimage.affine_transform
spline interpolation (BSD-3-Clause) and quickshear (BSD-3-Clause, Schimke & Hale 2011).
The GPU convolution blocking follows Neurodesk's gpu-unet WebGPU executor (MIT). src/dcm2niix and
public/coi-sw.js are adapted from EdgeReg (BSD-2-Clause, Chris Rorden).

The SME microkernel follows brainchop-core's FP32 SME implementation
(https://github.com/neuroneural/brainchop-core), under the MIT License:

