under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and are not part of this repository. tools/lower.py converts them to .shiva files; the converted
files are on the neurodeskorg/webapps Hugging Face dataset (models.json records licence, owner and
provenance). The models and this software are not for clinical use.

The macOS installer also contains niimath (BSD-2-Clause, Chris Rorden et al.,
https://github.com/rordenlab/niimath) linked with LLVM's OpenMP runtime (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).
